  "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits/32655-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits/32655-01.htm",
   "quest": 311,
   "text": "Cheiren: Us beacon watchers have been observing the Ragna Orcs for quite some time now. We've done all we can since the sparks of rebellion first erupted from their lands, but our efforts to control them have been fruitless so far.",
   "header": "Cheiren",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; (player.getLevel() >= MIN_LEVEL)"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Please tell me what happened.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits 32655-03.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits",
     "event": "32655-03.htm",
     "quest": 311,
     "to": "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits/32655-03.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits/32655-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits/32655-02.htm",
   "quest": 311,
   "text": "Cheiren: We Beacon Watchers have long watched the movements of the Ragna Orcs. Despite our efforts, though, rebellion seems inevitable. We have failed... Ah, but this is none of your concern. If you value your life, take my advice and leave this area as quickly as you can! (Only characters who are …",
   "header": "Cheiren",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; NOT (player.getLevel() >= MIN_LEVEL)"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits/32655-05.html": {
   "file": "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits/32655-05.html",
   "quest": 311,
   "text": "Cheiren: What's holding you back? If you're not up for this mission, you'd better let me know now... Otherwise, go hunt Ragna Orcs and the Evil Spirit of Baranka, the Destroyer of Baranka . Since they are possessed by evil spirits emanating from the Ragna Orc Amulets they wear, you must retrieve th…",
   "header": "Cheiren",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; !hasQuestItems(player, SOUL_CORE_CONTAINING_EVIL_SPIRIT, RAGNA_ORCS_AMULET)"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Say you want to quit.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits 32655-13.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits",
