  "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits/32655-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits/32655-04.htm",
   "quest": 311,
   "text": "Cheiren: Let me tell you about the mission. Hunt Ragna Orcs and the Evil Spirit of Baranka, the Destroyer of Baranka . Since they are possessed by evil spirits emanating from the Ragna Orc Amulets they wear, you must retrieve those accursed pendants. The more you bring me, the higher your reward. S…",
   "header": "Cheiren",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits/32655-11.html": {
   "file": "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits/32655-11.html",
   "quest": 311,
   "text": "Cheiren: You have brought back 10 Soul Cores! If I combine the power of these cores with this pendant... like... so. This is the Guardian Spirit's Pendant ! This item is absolutely necessary to stand against Varangka , the chief of the Ragna Orcs. Without this item, you will not be able to endure h…",
   "header": "Cheiren",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Settle other items.",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_multisell 2010",
     "kind": "multisell"
    },
    {
     "text": "Say that you are quitting the mission.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits 32655-13.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits",
     "event": "32655-13.html",
