  "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits/32655-13.html": {
   "file": "Q00311_ExpulsionOfEvilSpirits/32655-13.html",
   "quest": 311,
   "text": "Cheiren: You want to leave? Very well. I must respect your decision, and I thank you for your service. If we Orcs survive this threat, you will always be welcome at our hearths...",
